{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. Find, grab and process object. If object isn't valid, move to task location. Scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToTaskLocation    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = DoTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectValid    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
